---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Placard from '../../components/Placard.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
const updated = '2026-09-06';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of use"
  description="Terms governing use of the carbonproject.ai website."
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Terms of use"
    lede={`Terms governing your use of this website. Last updated ${updated}.`}
  />

  <div class="wrap band">
    <Placard tone="black" i={1} class="legal">
    <div class="flow">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p class="sub">
        This site is published by {site.legalName}, an Australian company established in
        {' '}{site.founded}, operating from {site.location.region}, {site.location.stateName}.
      </p>

      <h2>This site is information, not an offer</h2>
      <p>
        Descriptions of services, capability and specifications on this site are general information.
        They are not an offer capable of acceptance, and they do not form part of any contract. Any
        engagement with us is governed by a written scope and agreement signed by both parties, and
        where that document differs from this site, that document governs.
      </p>

      <h2>Specifications and availability</h2>
      <p>
        Equipment specifications quoted on this site are nominal and describe the class of equipment
        we operate. Actual specification, availability, lead time and price for any particular
        engagement or hire are confirmed in writing at quoting. Capacity is finite and is allocated
        under agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Nothing here is professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site is not engineering, legal, financial or safety advice for your specific
        situation, and should not be relied on as a substitute for an assessment of your site, your
        data or your obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Australian Consumer Law</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing in these terms excludes, restricts or modifies any guarantee, right or remedy you
        have under the <em>Competition and Consumer Act 2010</em> (Cth), including the Australian
        Consumer Law, where it cannot lawfully be excluded.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The content, drawings, diagrams and design of this site are our property or used with
        permission. You may read, print and share pages for your own business evaluation. You may not
        reproduce the site or substantial parts of it for commercial publication without our written
        permission.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Where we link to another organisation we do so for reference. We do not control those sites
        and are not responsible for their content.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of Victoria, Australia, and you submit to the
        non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of that state.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    </Placard>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 78ch; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: var(--t2); }
</style>
